{"unit_id":"tag:08XF:statement","translation":"若存在忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环（ring）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0001>，使得<MATH_0002>具有某种额外结构，事情就会更容易。例如，若能保证<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中是分裂（split）的，就可推出：模（module）或代数（algebra）的每个在基底扩张（base extension）下稳定（stable）且沿忠实平坦（faithfully flat）态射（morphisms）下降（descends）的性质，也沿普遍（universally）单射（injective）态射（morphisms）下降（descends）。一个显然的猜想是寻找<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>不仅忠实平坦（faithfully flat），而且在<MATH_0007>中是内射（injective）的；但即使对于<MATH_0008>，也不可能存在这样的同态（homomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"base extension","target_term":"基底扩张"},{"source_term":"stable","target_term":"稳定"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"环同态及模的忠实平坦性，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"环同态的来源和目标，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态","context":"环之间的同态，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂","context":"环范畴中映射的分裂，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"所讨论性质的对象，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所讨论性质的对象，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base extension","target_term":"基底扩张","context":"性质在扩张下稳定，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"stable","target_term":"稳定","context":"基底扩张下性质保持，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"沿其下降的态射，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降","context":"性质沿态射下降，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"张量后仍单射的条件，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"普遍单射态射中的单射性质，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"在模范畴中作为内射对象，与单射态射语境不同，词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
